{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可这点盼头一冒出来，他又难受起来：要是当初没走，如今又会怎样？他连自己后不后悔都说不清。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"离开以后，他想到往后遇上难受的事，恐怕还得自己熬过去；这才知道，从前有人在身边，心里会轻松多少。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"当初他只想着别再受委屈，没想到往后遇上难事时，还可能只能一个人熬；要是早想到这一层，他还会走吗？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼着还能有那份亲近，可当初受的委屈又拦着他；他也想找回最初离开时的那份坚决，却怎么也找不回来了。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"主要修正了两处心理因果。第一，S04的短暂愿望只是希望一切还能像从前，不能直接等同于已经想回去，因此保留后悔与否说不清的状态。第二，S06原先把离开后的孤独写成了已经反复发生的事实，但缺少具体经历支撑，改为对以后遇上难事可能只能独自承担的担忧；S07同步调整为可能性，使惊慌和反事实追问都有相应依据。S07-3也将想要亲近与决定回头分开，让S09后来分辨自己究竟想回去还是想有人陪伴成为真正的新认识。保留了短暂欢喜、对亲近的愿望、对委屈的顾虑，以及S11开始尝试、S12逐渐站稳、S13最终作出选择的推进。未改S12-3，是因为它可以作为中间阶段的继续生活意愿，和S13最终对未来关系及自我尊严的明确承诺有所区别。剩余风险：独自面对难事仍是人物对未来处境的推测，并非已经证实的反复经历；修订后没有再把它当作事实使用。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "143f4c17-a16f-462b-a8d0-3b97092046ad", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T172251026673Z", "elapsed_seconds": 120.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-03T17:24:51.827293+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "98fb09ae3803136f4f2afff27d59ea6ddd6c3d636b52daec6599aecea4d8f3a6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T172251026673Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fe9140578fed5469c7d98c75df42eb988235522c44f4035154cfa63102ae765e"}}}
